# EXPERIMENT E — command-scoped typed error with central hint rendering
#
# Base: astral-sh/uv@95637ecf70cbf3c8a8d11f424b9a654e8fefdf51
# Public issue: https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/uv/issues/21058
# Upstream reproduction: https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/21059
#
# Internal design sketch only.
#
# Goal: preserve C's command-only blast radius, but propagate a typed error to uv's
# normal top-level renderer instead of manually rendering inside tool/upgrade.rs.
# The wrapper gives all top-level inventory failures operation context and carries
# the tool root only when the source is the invalid-name variant.

