# Expected invalid-name family:
#
# error: Failed to inspect installed tools
#   Caused by: Not a valid package or extra name: "tool backup" ...
#
# hint: Inspect the uv tool directory at `<root>`; move the invalid directory outside it, or remove it
#
# Expected receipt-read I/O family:
#
# error: Failed to inspect installed tools
#   Caused by: failed to read from file `<root>/ruff/uv-receipt.toml`: Is a directory (...)
#
# No hint.
#
# Tradeoff:
# - 2 files;
# - command-scoped behavior like A/C;
# - normal propagation and central Hint rendering;
# - no exact offending child path;
# - diagnostics.rs owns a command-specific wrapper type.
